message: "This repository is a specification placeholder with no source code. If you reference the OES-512 layout, please cite it as below and describe it as TARGET / UNRUN."
title: "oes512-residual: OES-512 specification placeholder (16 × OES-32 residual blocks)"
type: software
authors:
