license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
abstract: >-
  Specification-only placeholder recording the planned OES-512 layout: 512
  channels as 16 blocks of 32 (16 × OES-32), each block evaluated with the
  normative OES-32 residual (ADR-001), combined by a weighted latch. The layout
  and weighted latch are TARGET. No source code is published; nothing has been
  run (UNRUN); no metrics or results.
keywords:
  - oes512
  - oes32
  - residual
  - specification
  - placeholder
